Pneumatica Didatica
Independent educational extension for Hopsan.

Uses the Hopsan component API and NodePneumatic conventions.
Hopsan is developed by the Hopsan Group at Linkoping University.
Hopsan is not affiliated with or responsible for this extension.

The valve symbols were drawn for this project using conventional fluid-power
notation. References: ISO 1219-1 and Festo MPA-S public technical catalogue.
No ISO publication or Festo artwork is distributed here.
No claim of full standards compliance or FluidSIM equivalence is made.
